# Reference implementations used ONLY to cross-validate and benchmark the
# native arms -- never imported by morie itself. Deliberately unpinned and
# outside requirements-lock.txt: these are the packages the native code
# replaced, and a supply-chain lock over the runtime tree should not carry
# them.
#
#   DoubleML    -- tests/fn/test_douml.py, tests/test_causal_new.py
#                  (both pytest.skipif-guarded; the native DML runs
#                  40-61x faster and is checked against it)
#   matplotlib  -- pytest.importorskip in the plot tests, plus one
#                  dynamic __import__ in src/morie/tps_render.py
#   the rest    -- comparison baselines for the numeric arms
